# KEY=value lines. ./bootstrap --stack foldkit replaces {{KEY}} and {{KEY: description}}
# placeholders in the project's docs with these values.
INSTALL_CMD=pnpm install
DEV_CMD=pnpm dev
BUILD_CMD=pnpm build
CHECK_CMD=./scripts/check.sh
TEST_CMD=pnpm exec vitest run
SHIP_GATE=./scripts/check.sh && ./scripts/coverage.sh && pnpm exec playwright test && node scripts/coverage-tiers.mjs --journeys
STACK=Foldkit (the Elm architecture on Effect v4) in the browser; TypeScript 7 with the Effect language service (patched tsc); Vite 8; Vitest 5 Story/Scene tests; Playwright journeys; Oxlint (type-aware) and Oxfmt; pnpm 12 on Node 24; Perl for bounded network commands.
COVERAGE_ENFORCEMENT=./scripts/coverage.sh: vitest --coverage (v8, json-summary), then scripts/coverage-tiers.mjs independently enforces 90% lines and 90% branches globally plus per-tier line, branch and function floors from coverage-tiers.json; tier members missing from the report fail; after the E2E run, --journeys fails unless every named journey in coverage-tiers.json ran and passed (Playwright's JSON report); fail-closed in CI, with a ratchet on pull requests
RELEVANT_DOCS=docs/guides/foldkit.md, FOLDKIT.md (Foldkit's conventions; Foldkit owns it), the vendored Foldkit source in repos/foldkit (scripts/vendor-foldkit.sh), ENGINEERING.md and TESTING.md
